 "summary": "The new Mellin-strip and half-line material has no counterpart in Mathlib, TauCeti, Physlib or EpsilonEridani: Mathlib's MellinTransform has no convergence monotonicity in Re s, no indicator-extension lemmas, and only LocallyIntegrable.indicator (not the Ioc\u2192Ioi form). The PR routes its substance through existing upstream API (mellin_convergent_iff_norm, mellinConvergent_of_isBigO_rpow, mellin_differentiableAt_of_isBigO_rpow, hasMellin_cpow_Ioc, integrableOn_Ioo_rpow_iff, aestronglyMeasurable_smul_iff\u2080, ContinuousLinearMap.locallyIntegrableOn_comp, IsUpperSet.ordConnected) rather than reproving it.",
